  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Add all ingredients except sodium sulfide. Adjust medium to pH 7.2; dispense anaerobically under 100% N2; and sterilize by steaming at 100C for 30 minutes on each of three consecutive days."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Reduce medium just prior to inoculation by adding sterile 5% sodium sulfide to a final concentration of 0.5 g/L."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 2.0 with 10 N H2SO4 (at room temperature). Filtersterilize."
    }
  ]
}